<!doctype html>
<html lang="en"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><meta name="color-scheme" content="dark"><title>KITTY V7 · Prometheus 3D Studio</title><style>__STYLE__</style></head>
<body>
<header class="header"><div class="brand"><span class="brand-icon">P<span>↗</span></span><div>PROMETHEUS<small>ROBOTICS / DESIGN STUDIO</small></div></div><div class="project">KITTY <span>V7</span><small>STRUCTURE EXPLORER</small></div><div class="header-status"><span class="dot"></span><span id="gpu-status">Starting 3D…</span><span class="offline">OFFLINE READY</span></div></header>
<main class="workspace">
<aside class="controls" aria-label="Model controls">
<div class="section-label">01 / EXPLORE</div>
<div class="segmented" id="layout"><button data-layout="assembly" class="active" aria-pressed="true">Assembled</button><button data-layout="exploded" aria-pressed="false">Exploded</button><button data-layout="print" aria-pressed="false">Parts</button></div>
<div class="row label-row"><label for="explode">Explode assembly</label><output id="explode-value">0%</output></div><input id="explode" type="range" min="0" max="100" value="0">
<div class="row label-row"><label for="render-mode">Surface</label><select id="render-mode"><option value="studio">Studio</option><option value="wire">Wireframe</option><option value="xray">X-ray</option><option value="technical">Blueprint</option></select></div>
<div class="check-grid"><label><input id="edges" type="checkbox" checked> Feature edges</label><label><input id="ghost" type="checkbox"> See inside</label><label><input id="hardware" type="checkbox" checked> Bought hardware</label><label><input id="optional" type="checkbox"> Optional battery</label><label><input id="grid" type="checkbox" checked> Floor grid</label><label><input id="dimensions" type="checkbox"> Dimensions</label><label><input id="labels" type="checkbox"> Part labels</label><label><input id="rotate" type="checkbox"> Turntable</label></div>
<div class="row label-row"><label for="cut">Section cut</label><select id="cut-axis" aria-label="Section axis"><option value="z">Height Z</option><option value="x">Width X</option><option value="y">Depth Y</option></select></div><input id="cut" type="range" min="0" max="100" value="100"><div class="subtle" id="cut-value">Complete model · no section</div>
<div class="section-label">02 / CAMERA</div><div class="camera-grid" id="camera-presets"><button data-view="iso">↗ Isometric</button><button data-view="front">↓ Front</button><button data-view="rear">↑ Rear / tail</button><button data-view="side">→ Side</button><button data-view="top">⊙ Top</button><button data-view="bottom">⊗ Underside</button></div>
<div class="section-label">03 / PARTS <span id="part-count"></span></div><div class="part-actions"><button id="isolate">Isolate selected</button><button id="show-all">Show all</button></div><div class="parts-list" id="parts-list"></div>
<details class="notes"><summary>Model &amp; controls</summary><p>Drag to orbit · right-drag to pan · scroll or pinch to zoom. Click a part to inspect; double-click to focus. F fits the view; W toggles wireframe; R resets.</p><p>Warm shells and orange mounts are printable CAD. Wheels, motors, phone, sonar and caster are reference envelopes, not print parts. Optional internal tray and unselected AA-holder envelope start hidden.</p><p>Wireframe shows mesh structure, not electrical wiring. Physical fits and printer settings still need the fit-first checks in the V7 service kit. Exploded positions illustrate parts, not a verified assembly sequence.</p><details><summary>Three.js license</summary><pre>__LICENSE__</pre></details></details>
</aside>
<section class="stage" id="stage" aria-label="Interactive V7 robot model">
<div class="stage-top"><div><div class="eyebrow">KITTY SENTINEL / V7</div><h1>A body with<br><em>personality.</em></h1></div><div class="stage-badges"><span>mm · 1:1 geometry</span><span id="visible-count">Loading parts</span></div></div>
<div class="saved" id="saved"><input id="saved-iso" type="radio" name="saved" checked><input id="saved-front" type="radio" name="saved"><input id="saved-rear" type="radio" name="saved"><input id="saved-inside" type="radio" name="saved"><div class="saved-images"><img class="saved-iso" src="__ISO__" alt="Verified native V7 CAD assembled isometric view"><img class="saved-front" src="__FRONT__" alt="V7 front with PROMETHEUS relief"><img class="saved-rear" src="__REAR__" alt="V7 rear and detachable tail"><img class="saved-inside" src="__INSIDE__" alt="V7 internal components with covers hidden"></div><div class="saved-controls"><label for="saved-iso">Isometric</label><label for="saved-front">Front</label><label for="saved-rear">Rear</label><label for="saved-inside">Inside</label></div><p id="fallback-message">Preparing the GPU view. Saved native CAD views are available below.</p><button id="retry">Retry 3D</button><noscript><p>Enable JavaScript for interactive 3D. These saved CAD views work without JavaScript.</p></noscript></div>
<canvas id="viewport" tabindex="0" aria-label="Robot 3D canvas. Drag to rotate, scroll to zoom; arrow keys rotate; F fits; W toggles wireframe."></canvas><div id="part-labels" aria-hidden="true"></div><div id="dimension-labels" aria-hidden="true"></div>
<div class="selection" id="selection" hidden><div class="section-label" id="selection-kind">PRINTABLE PART</div><h2 id="selection-title"></h2><p id="selection-size"></p><div class="part-actions"><button id="focus">Focus</button><button id="download-part">Save STL</button><button id="clear-selection" aria-label="Clear selection">×</button></div></div>
<div class="canvas-tools"><button id="zoom-in" aria-label="Zoom in">+</button><button id="zoom-out" aria-label="Zoom out">−</button><button id="fit">Fit</button><button id="reset">Reset</button><button id="snapshot">PNG ↗</button><button id="fullscreen" aria-label="Fullscreen">⛶</button></div>
<div class="stage-bottom"><div><span class="dot"></span> <span id="mode-status">LIVE 3D / STUDIO</span><small>V7 service revision · physical fit pending</small></div><span class="gesture-hint">DRAG TO ORBIT <b>·</b> SCROLL TO ZOOM</span><div class="axis-legend"><i>X</i><i>Y</i><i>Z</i></div></div>
</section>
</main><footer><span>ENGINEERED BY PROMETHEUS <b>✦</b> MADE FOR KITTY</span><div><label for="quality">Render quality</label><select id="quality"><option value="auto">Balanced</option><option value="ultra">Ultra · high DPI</option><option value="eco">Lightweight</option></select><span id="performance">GPU renderer</span></div></footer>
<script id="model-data" type="application/json">__MODEL__</script><script>__THREE__</script><script>__ORBIT__</script><script>__APP__</script></body></html>
